  "slug": "hive",
  "name": "Hive",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Bio-inspired swarm orchestrator for Claude Code. Breaks tasks into parallel subtasks, coordinates agents through stigmergy, learns across sessions with pheromone scoring, and scales concurrency adaptively. 16 mechanisms from ant colonies, honeybee swarms, and AI research.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **3 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (3): `hive`, `hiverev` (Persona-driven review of anything, from any angle), `hivesim` (Strategic wargame engine)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install hive@claude-community` from `CipherandRow/claude-hive-plugin`.\n\nA multi-agent orchestration skill that coordinates parallel Claude Code agents using mechanisms from ant colonies, honeybee swarms, and AI research.",
